{"path":"/zh/concepts/capability-certification-lifecycle/","title":"能力认证生命周期：能力如何取得自动运行权","blocks":[{"block_id":"adps-9556f3f447e4db88-1","revision":"9556f3f447e4db88d1a8761573a4120220768789adb54591f9da9cb029781f9f","tag":"p","quote":"Coding Agent 生成一条新的数据发布管线，并不意味着它可以立刻自动接收生产任务。团队需要先显式运行完整样例，检查真实交付，再决定是否开放自动路由。"},{"block_id":"adps-338b2f3a225b86fc-1","revision":"338b2f3a225b86fc3687aaa1b68eeab4c7f5f6b3b76b1c91237768485e10bff6","tag":"p","quote":"能力认证生命周期规定生成或修改后的能力怎样取得、保持和失去自动运行权。玄宿案例采用三种状态："},{"block_id":"adps-5d3efc0916f6be93-1","revision":"5d3efc0916f6be93dcd7b5c6b93d4010eb185e091e6bd71e6c1da02a51eec9d9","tag":"pre","quote":"draft -> candidate -> active 草稿 已通过首跑 获得自动接单权"},{"block_id":"adps-9cb3fe05170802d8-1","revision":"9cb3fe05170802d8ecbd9d94072ebf3a0e1e33902cb396cad68471cb82c3d5e5","tag":"p","quote":"首次完整运行通过证据门后进入 candidate；人员确认范围和风险后进入 active。代码、模板或关键规则发生版本漂移时，旧认证自动失效，能力退回待认证状态。"},{"block_id":"adps-f231b5e2e654b635-1","revision":"f231b5e2e654b635882f091c05175e36a382f7ec5d1d887a69653b89a18d37cc","tag":"p","quote":"状态必须控制真实运行权限，不能只作为页面标签。认证要绑定具体版本、样例和证据。高风险能力还需要权限、影响范围和回滚能力共同参与准入。"},{"block_id":"adps-ebc1cb5aec1e5258-1","revision":"ebc1cb5aec1e52585694353db43c7a7ebf1f5af90a7f3392a6daae02d601376a","tag":"li","quote":"初始案例：玄宿科技 GIS 数据发布 Agent，案例提供熊钰柯（Yuke Xiong）。"},{"block_id":"adps-08c5f0842db6c160-1","revision":"08c5f0842db6c1606325a757c445332f98299fdd6f9ce9efdf747069f44a1491","tag":"li","quote":"历史近邻：artifact registry、staging/production promotion、model registry、progressive delivery。"},{"block_id":"adps-91a56506763c37f6-1","revision":"91a56506763c37f693115c89d01040dc9cf431ebcee9d9fe5599e7a6f9e8eb3c","tag":"li","quote":"ADPS 整理：把对象扩展为管线、技能、工具封装或 Agent 子流程，并明确自动运行权。"},{"block_id":"adps-c04f929401613946-1","revision":"c04f92940161394663ccdc8b2c376af7bf1ee7de19b5252dd73db4a1410709c1","tag":"p","quote":"初始来源：玄宿科技 GIS 数据发布 Agent 案例报告；案例提供：熊钰柯（Yuke Xiong）。"},{"block_id":"adps-07336cb1f093d306-1","revision":"07336cb1f093d306f9f6694518f0138fa9925bd53440f26b6e21d427504c348d","tag":"p","quote":"案例报告目录 · 模式目录 · CC BY 4.0"},{"block_id":"adps-3c551855df185a69-1","revision":"3c551855df185a69bba5e6c436054cab73b1e5df7050f512e066b3f937c0e637","tag":"p","quote":"在 ADPS Chronicle 中查看"}]}
